book: 00.00.10.work

## Goal
Reduce Director supervision of routine repair cycles while preserving useful
visibility, hard stops for consequential choices, development dialogue and page
completion reports. Primary agreement: evidence/director-agreement.md.

## Proposed operation
Prime explicitly chooses continue, director-input, develop or complete with source-
bound evidence/reason. These are tool data, not >commands. Compute does not infer
semantic alignment or authenticate approval from a header, model name or word yes.
Continue: short substantive report of return/result, Prime finding, alignment and
next bounded action, followed by clearly headed For [model] prompt where needed.
Director-input: explain issue, options/consequences/recommendation and exact question;
hold affected dependent execution until an attributed answer resolves that question.
Develop: back-and-forth exploration; proposals remain proposals until recorded decision
and authorized task. Complete: full report of outcome, evidence, limits, learning,
preservation routes and useful next choice. Not automatic closure from green tests.
30–60 seconds is a reader target, not a word-count gate or padding requirement.
No concealed defects: routine defects remain in records and briefly summarized.

## Local work agreement
A work page records goal, authorized scope/resources, independent Prime choices,
Director-required choices, finish conditions and source-bound decisions/replies.
Missing boundaries cause clarification/attention, not guessed authority or all-stop
for unrelated work. Record conflicts with existing grants; no silent widening.

## Placement and integration
0063.role-prime: responsibility and escalation.0039.report: report behavior.
0500 workflow door and relevant callers: next action/hold/completion contract.
Individual work page: local goal/grant/finish/decisions. Existing source text stays
preserved; builder proposes additive candidate amendments, not direct law seating.
0512 builds adapter in labs/prime-review-pass01, against accepted committed helpers.
0412 holds design. Colab implementation outputs and desk-state return are unreviewed
and not dependencies. Later connect accepted Colab code explicitly after review.

## Acceptance
Demonstrate routine correction, source-bound Director hold and response, development
without execution, and meaningful completion report using disposable fixtures plus
one committed-source report draft. Prime actual-use check follows return review.
This slice cannot globally enforce callers that have not integrated its guard.
